      "text": "Fig 3, 'Digital health supply chain'. Six purple hexagons surround an icon labelled Individuals: digital ecosystem, end-to-end visibility, data and analytics, transactional systems, advanced digitization and collaborative processes. A dashed ring around them carries eleven partners as dots: Ministry of health, community health, health facilities, regional warehouses, private sector, central warehouse, regulators, logistics providers, procurers and manufacturers/distributors.",
